@startuml
title Idempotency V1.1 - 完整状态机

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state "ABSENT\n无持久记录" as ABSENT

state "PROCESSING\n持久状态\nownerToken + version\nprocessingExpireAt" as PROCESSING

state "PROCESSING_ACTIVE\n判定视图\nstatus=PROCESSING\nnow < expireAt" as PROCESSING_ACTIVE

state "PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n判定视图\nstatus仍然是PROCESSING\nnow >= expireAt" as PROCESSING_EXPIRED

state "SUCCESS\n持久终态\noptional result" as SUCCESS

state "FAILED\n持久状态\nfailureCode\nfailureRetryable" as FAILED

state "FAILED_RETRYABLE\n判定视图" as FAILED_RETRYABLE

state "FAILED_FINAL\n判定视图" as FAILED_FINAL

[*] --> ABSENT


' ==============================
' 首次抢占
' ==============================

ABSENT --> PROCESSING : NORMAL tryAcquire\nINSERT / Lua CAS\nowner=A\nversion=1

PROCESSING --> PROCESSING_ACTIVE : now < processingExpireAt
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING_EXPIRED : now >= processingExpireAt


' ==============================
' 正常执行成功
' ==============================

PROCESSING_ACTIVE --> SUCCESS : callback success\nmarkSuccess(owner=A,version=1)\nCAS success


' ==============================
' 正常执行失败
' ==============================

PROCESSING_ACTIVE --> FAILED : callback exception\nFailureClassifier\nmarkFailed(owner,version)


' ==============================
' 重复请求
' ==============================

PROCESSING_ACTIVE --> PROCESSING_ACTIVE : NORMAL duplicate\nreturn PROCESSING\ncallback 不执行

SUCCESS --> SUCCESS : same key + same requestHash\nreturn REPLAYED

SUCCESS --> SUCCESS : same key + different requestHash\nreturn KEY_CONFLICT\nrecord 不变


' ==============================
' PROCESSING 超时
' ==============================

PROCESSING_EXPIRED --> PROCESSING_EXPIRED : NORMAL execute\nreturn PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n不自动接管

PROCESSING_EXPIRED --> FAILED : RECOVERY tryRecover\nCAS old owner/version\nfailureCode=PROCESSING_TIMEOUT\nfailureRetryable=true


' ==============================
' FAILED 分类
' ==============================

FAILED --> FAILED_RETRYABLE : failureRetryable=true
FAILED --> FAILED_FINAL : failureRetryable=false

FAILED_RETRYABLE --> FAILED_RETRYABLE : NORMAL execute\nreturn PREVIOUS_FAILED_RETRYABLE

FAILED_FINAL --> FAILED_FINAL : NORMAL execute\nreturn PREVIOUS_FAILED_FINAL


' ==============================
' 可靠任务恢复
' ==============================

FAILED_RETRYABLE --> PROCESSING : RECOVERY allowed\nnew owner=B\nversion=old+1\nnew processingExpireAt

FAILED_FINAL --> FAILED_FINAL : RECOVERY rejected\n不可恢复


' ==============================
' 旧执行者恢复
' ==============================

PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : stale owner markSuccess / markFailed\nowner/version CAS=0\nreturn OWNERSHIP_LOST


' ==============================
' SHORT_TERM Window
' ==============================

SUCCESS --> ABSENT : SHORT_TERM\nwindowExpireAt reached\nrecord deleted

FAILED --> ABSENT : SHORT_TERM\nwindowExpireAt reached\nrecord deleted


note right of PROCESSING
PROCESSING 是唯一真正的“执行中”持久状态。

PROCESSING_ACTIVE / PROCESSING_EXPIRED
只是根据 processingExpireAt 得出的判定视图，
不要写成数据库 status。
end note

note right of FAILED
FAILED 是否能重新执行，
由 failureRetryable / failureCode /
RecoveryPolicy 决定。

不要增加 FAILED_TIMEOUT、
FAILED_FINAL 等大量数据库枚举。
end note

note bottom of PROCESSING_EXPIRED
普通 execute() 不负责恢复。

可靠任务组件调用 recover()
才允许状态接管。
end note

note bottom of SUCCESS
SHORT_TERM:
window 到期后删除，可重新执行。

DURABLE:
默认长期保存，不因 TTL 自动消失。
end note

@enduml